VisAlloc
Copyright 2026 VisAlloc authors

This release includes the VisAlloc training integration developed by Tian Chen
and collaborators, derived from the Vision-OPD and verl implementations.

Third-party software:
- Vision-OPD (https://github.com/VisionOPD/Vision-OPD), Apache-2.0.
  Upstream runtime base: c8a8fdd1f88eef1b5ef4fe6a8d64eb0272917471.
- verl (https://github.com/volcengine/verl), Apache-2.0.
  Original copyright notices remain in the corresponding source files.

VisAlloc modifications include paired negative-teacher inputs and scoring,
token sensitivity and distribution-disagreement admission, frozen token priors,
inverse-frequency bonus redistribution, and public data/training utilities.

The method and comparison figures are from the VisAlloc paper.

The VisAlloc-6K dataset is derived from Vision-OPD-6K:
https://huggingface.co/datasets/Kaelyn01/VisAlloc-6K
https://huggingface.co/datasets/yuanqianhao/Vision-OPD-6K
The data and photographs retain their separate upstream terms. This code license
does not grant additional rights to the underlying images.
